, "title": "Moderna mRNA vaccine almost halves the risk of skin cancer returning", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03417-0?utm_source=x&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=nature&linkId=64211417&error=cookies_not_supported&code=f9829c7c-6ce8-43d8-ae6f-3f968a087898", "url": "https://t.co/Fz7yaxstFQ"}]}, "id": "2113599158850314344", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 48, "impression_count": 32056, "like_count": 265, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 17, "retweet_count": 67}, "text": "A more than 40% risk reduction “would send many researchers over the Moon”. This personalised mRNA vaccine reduced the risk of skin cancer returning or the recipient dying by 42%\n\nhttps://t.co/Fz7yaxstFQ", "url": "https://x.com/Nature/status/2113599158850314344"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113587827565051904"]}, "author_id": "26832834", "created_at": "2026-10-23T11:06:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113587830106796051"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 11, "start": 4, "tag": "ESMO26"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/DXQylHc5my", "end": 295, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NatureMedicine/status/2113587830106796051/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113587827565051904", "start": 272, "url": "https://t.co/DXQylHc5my"}]}, "id": "2113587830106796051", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2795, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Now #ESMO26: In a phase 2 trial evaluating an off-the-shelf peptide vaccine in patients with mKRAS PDAC, the 1ry endpoint of DFS was not met but prespecified analyses showed that significant DFS was seen in the vaccine arm in patients with ctDNA- disease. dlvr.​it/TW27M9 https://t.co/DXQylHc5my", "url": "https://x.com/NatureMedicine/status/2113587830106796051"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113586634876977152"]}, "author_id": "26832834", "created_at": "2026-10-23T11:01:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113586641826930791"], "entities": {"hashtags":